      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my electric water heater is making this weird knocking sound lately and the water isn't getting as hot as it used to. any idea what's causing that or should i just call a plumber? i'm in melbourne so im hoping it's nothing too crazy.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
